{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing mushroom-foraging simulator that immerses you in a peaceful forest atmosphere through meditative gameplay. If you miss mushroom picking\u2014or have never tried it\u2014here\u2019s your chance to escape the city bustle and find inner peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Numerous mushroom species await you</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From chanterelles and porcini to russulas and toadstools\u2014collect everything in sight or hunt only for valuable specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/b21477e2350bb5284a5d4be4803d1e65.poster.avif?t=1772493979\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/b21477e2350bb5284a5d4be4803d1e65.webm?t=1772493979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/b21477e2350bb5284a5d4be4803d1e65.mp4?t=1772493979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pickle your mushrooms</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single mushroom, a whole batch of one species, or a signature mix\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/d54f31d27f39c8914a7ea8f281a19276.poster.avif?t=1772493979\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/d54f31d27f39c8914a7ea8f281a19276.webm?t=1772493979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/d54f31d27f39c8914a7ea8f281a19276.mp4?t=1772493979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dry your mushrooms</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop firewood, light the stove, and dry mushrooms over the coals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/5d53bc4ac9c621ac339fbb7f3031ff7b.poster.avif?t=1772493979\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/5d53bc4ac9c621ac339fbb7f3031ff7b.webm?t=1772493979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/extras/5d53bc4ac9c621ac339fbb7f3031ff7b.mp4?t=1772493979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424910?t=1772493979","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424910?t=1772493979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/4e5b7cc62710a1dbadf64e0441c9c88503225cc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772493979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424910/4e5b7cc62710a1dbadf64e0441c9c88503225cc3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772493979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3460890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing mushroom-foraging simulator that immerses you in a peaceful forest atmosphere through meditative gameplay. If you miss mushroom picking\u2014or have never tried it\u2014here\u2